      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-12T13:00:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 to extracting all of smccc to somewhere that isn\u0027t trng/psci/pkvm specific.\nArguably it should be a separate external crate, like psci - which would allow psci to depend on it.\n(Alternatively, we could just expose the smccc module from psci, and live with the name.)\n@qwandor@google.com might have an opinion",
      "parentUuid": "6de8e2a8_1164965f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "921d92a2ad382060c3aca253b2dda06896d9902b",
